<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu vya Ezra na Nehemia vyatamwila ivyo wantu we isi ya Izulaeli walekeeilwe kuya kwe isi yawo ya Izulaeli umo weze waheze kwila uge watahwa wa nkondo mwe izisi za Uwajemi na Babeli. Nehemia aika mtintiso wakwe mo kutamwila kwakwe ivyo ichiwambaza chizunguluke umzi wa Yelusalemu uzengigwe nkanana ya kaidi. Watakusoma walozize wa mbuliza Bibbiliya wazumila kugamba Ezila awandikaga ivitabu vya Mbuli za Mihiliomo 1 na 2, iviya na ivitabu vya Ezila na Nehemiya, hamwenga na kuvika mo kuwandwa kwakwe. Mna uneva mntu aviwandike suyo Ezila, elo, vyadahika mntu mtuhu kavika ivitabu vino mo luwandwa kwakwe. Vyafanyanywa kugamba chitabu cha Nehemiya chaikagwa mo kuwandwa kwakwe mo mhilimo wa 430 Kulisito henati Kwelekwa. Nehemiya endaga nuyo mta undima wenye wo kumywesa seuta Alitashasita. Nehemiya amlombezaga seuta amleke auye komzi wa Yelusalemu chani akambize kuzenga iviwambaza vyo umzi wa Yelusalemu izo zendaga zibogozoka. Alitashasita kamleka Nehemiya adamanye saivyo, vikaheza nyumani niyo amsagula Nehemiya atende sekulu uko komzi wa Yudea, hantu hauzunguluka umzi wa Yelusalemu 5:14. Hata hegu kwendaga na wantu wasiku wajezaga kumchinda Nehemiya asekuzenga iviwambaza vya Yelusalemu, kwa wambizi wa Chohile, ndima iyo yahezaga kwa chipindi chjihi cha mazuwa 52 ayodu. Nyumani, Ezila niyo amwambiza Nehemiya kuwalongoza Waizulaeli kudika uhya lagano dyawo na Chohile.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yemndani,</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula 1 kubula 6 zatambalisa ivyo Nehemiya awiye Yelusalemu na kulongoza indima yo kuzenga uhya ichiwambaza cha Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula 7 kubula 13 zatambalisa ivyo Waizuaeli wakongile kwikwla vituhu Yelusalemu, na kukonga vituhu kutimila sigilizi za Chohile.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Ino ikutimila ni milosi ya Nehemiya mwana ywa Hakaliya.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="NEH 1:1">Ndima ya Nehemiya momzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Mo mwezi wa Kisileu wo mhilimo wa milongo midi wo ulongozi wa seuta Atashasita, umo nendile kwengome ye idizumba dya seuta mo mzi wa Shushani. <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Hanani yumwe ywa walukolo wangu, ezaga akalaila kweisi ya Yuda hamwenga na wantu watuhu, niyo nawauza kuwalanga Wayahudi wawiye kulawa ko usamizo uko Babeli na icho chilaile komzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Niyo wanigamba, “Wadya wachulupuke kwigalwa kosamizo nawo wawiye mwe isi yawo wemwenkuto ikulise na soni. Chiwambaza chomzi wa Yelusalemu chibogozolwa na izinyivi zakwe zitikimywa moto.” <verse eid="NEH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Eze nive izimbuli izo niyo nekala na kwila. Kwa mazuwa masiku silomboleza na kufunga na kulombeza kulongozi kwa Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Haheza niyo nagamba, “Weye Zumbe, Chohile ywa kwembingu, mkulu mta kogofya, weye ukutoza idilagano dyako na kulagisa ungi wako hewine udumo kwa wadya wakutoza amalagizo yako. <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />Nikaula miye mndima ywako wetegeleze malombezo ya mndima ywako akulombeza kulongozi kwako chilo na msi kwa chausa cha wandima wako, wantu wa Izulaeli. Nakweila masa yetu suwe Waizulaeli, hamwenga na masa yangu na masa ya walukolo wangu, chazumila kugamba chikolola masa. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Chidamanya masa yakulise kwako. Hachitimile imiko na malagizo na sigilizi uchinkile kujinkila kwa Musa mndima ywako.” <verse eid="NEH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />“Nakulombeza kumbuka idilagizo umlagize Musa mndima ywako, ukagamba, ‘Uneva mnajendeleza kuswesa ukanuni naniwamwaganise mwe wantu we izisi ntuhu. <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />Mna mnaniwiya na kutimila imiko yangu, aho hata hegu wantu wenyu wakwikala ko usamizo wehale vitendese uhelo we isi, naniwachisanye na kuwegala hatu nisagule chani wantu wanivikile aho.’” <verse eid="NEH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />Zumbe Chohile, “Wano ni wandima na wantu wako ukombole kwa udahi wako mkulu na mkono wako udahise. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, tegeleza amalombezo yangu miye mndima ywako na malombezo ya wandima wako wakubweda kukutunya weye. Dyelo uninke miye mndima ywako kuwonelwa mbazi kulongozi kwa seuta.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Mwe chipindi icho miye nendaga mta kwinkiza vya kunywa kwa seuta.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiya aita Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Eze ijinke myezi mine, mhilimo wa milongo midi yo ulongozi wa seuta Atashasita, umo idivai ikatenda kulongozi kwakwe, niyo naiguha namwinka seuta. Seuta niyo aniwona hatenda simema chinyulu mwe idizuwa idyo. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Elo, seuta niyo anuza, “Ni mbwani walagisa una chinyulu wenawe hwimnyonje? Weye huna chintu chituhu ukaleka chinyulu cha moyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Niyo nogohesa.” <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Mna niyo namgamba seuta, “Seuta wikale mazuwa yose! Kwambwani nsekutenda na chinyulu naye umzi wahambigwe wakale wangu usigaila mahame ne izinyivi zakwe zitikimya moto?” <verse eid="NEH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Seuta niyo anigamba, “Togola, icho ukunga ni chibwani?” Aho, niyo nalombeza chimoyomoyo kwa Chohile ywa kwembingu. <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />Haheza niyo namhitula seuta “Hegu vyakuwagila weye seuta naho hegu mndima ywako kazumilwa kulongozi kwakwe nisigila nite kweisi ya Yuda komzi hantu wakale wangu wahambigwe chani nidahe kuuzenga uhya.” <verse eid="NEH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Seuta akatenda kekala hajihi na mkaziwe niyo anuza, “Ntambo yako naiguhe mazuwa mengahi, wenawe nauye ini?” Niyo namgambila seuta utali we intambo yangu na amazuwa nanikale uko, seuta niyo azumila. <verse eid="NEH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Iviya niyo namgambila, “Hegu vikakuwagila weye seuta, nakweila uninke baluwa hawalagise masekulu we ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa yomto wa Eufulati, vileke wanileke nibule kweisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Iviya nakweila uninke baluwa nimwigaile Asafu uyo akutunduliya imbago ya seuta chani aninke miti nidamanye mbawo kwachausa che izifilemu ze izinyivi ze ingome ye Inyumba ya Chohile na kwachausa che izinyivi ze ichiwambaza chomzi na hantu howikazi wangu nanikale.” Kwaviya udahi na wedi wa Chohile ywangu nendile wihamwenga na miye, seuta niyo azumila idilombezo dyangu. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Seuta nendile kasigila masekulu wa wagomba nkondo na wakwela falasi waite hamwenga na miye, niyo chabula kwa vilongozi wa ntendele ya kaidi yomto wa Eufulati niyo nawenka izibaluwa za seuta. <verse eid="NEH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Mna Sanibalati kulawa komzi wa Holoni na Tobiya chilongozi kulawa Kwa Waamoni weze weve imbuli iyo, niyo wehiwa vitendese kugamba keza mntu akunga awadamanyize mbuli zedi Waizulaeli.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Nize nibule Yelusalemu niyo nekala uko kwa mazuwa matatu, <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />yeze yomboke amazuwa ayo, niyo nakulawa nechilo hamwenga na wantu wajeche. Sigambile mntu yoyose icho Chohile ywangu aikiye mo moyo wangu nidamanye kwachausa chomzi wa Yelusalemu. Mnyama uyodu nendile ninanaye ni impunda iyodu nikweile. <verse eid="NEH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Nafosa kuse komzi kujinkila inchili ya kwedikolongo kuhinga kwedisima dikwitangwa Zoka na inchili ikwitangwa Zalazala, silaula iviwambaza vya Yelusalemu vyendile vibogozolwa ne izinchili zakwe zitikimya moto. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Haheza niyo nahinga kubula kwenchili ye sokwe ne idibwawa dya seuta, mna impunda yangu idunduga kujinka kwaviya nendile kuna visungu vya makalankala, <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />ivyo ichilo icho niyo chajinkila mnkanda mo mto wa Kiduloni nalaula iviwambaza. Haheza niyo chauya na kwingila vituhu kujinkila kwe Nchili ya kwedikolongo. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Masekulu hawamanyize uko nitile na icho hudamanya, kwaviya nendile sinati kuwagambila chochose Wayahudi hegu walavyantambiko hegu vilongozi hegu masekulu hegu mntu yoyose nadamanye indima yo kuzenga uhya umzi. <verse eid="NEH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Aho niyo nawagamba, “Nkunto chinanazo mwaziwona! Yelusalemu usigala mahame ne izinyivi zakwe zitikimya moto. Soni chizenge uhya ichiwambaza cha Yelusalemu, chani chisekutenda na soni vituhu.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Iviya siwagambila ivyo Chohile endile hamwenga na miye na kunambiza na ivyo seuta anigambile. Niyo wanihitula, “Nivyedi, leka chikonge kuzenga vituhu.” Ivyo niyo wakonga indima iyo yedi. <verse eid="NEH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Mna Sanibalati na Tobiya na mwalabu akwitangwa Geshomu weze weve imbuli iyo niyo wachitila na kuchiseka. Niyo wauza, “Vino mwadamanya mbwani? Togolani mwamhituka seuta?” <verse eid="NEH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Niyo nawahitula nawagamba, “Chohile ywa kwembingu nachambize chidahe kudamanya indima ino. Suwe wandima wakwe nachikonge kuzenga uhya, mna kwenyu nyuwe hamtende na fungu hegu chenyu hegu lukumbusa lwa uwagilwa momzi wa Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s">Viwambaza vya Yelusalemu chazengwa uhya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Mazina ya wano wantu nawo wambizane kuzenga ichiwambaza chomzi wa Yelusalemu. Eliyabu mlavyantambiko mkulu na walavyatambiko weyawe waitaga wakudamanya ndima ya kuzenga uhya inchili ikwitangwa ya Ngoto. Waikukiza na kwika izivyivi ahantu hakwe, wazenga kubula mnala wa gana dimwenga, uwo niyo wausenta kwachausa cha Chohile kubula mnala wa Hananeli. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Wantu wa Yeliko wazenga hantu hatimile, hantu hatimile hazengwa ni Zahuli mwana ywa Imli. <verse eid="NEH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Inchili ye Izisamaki izengwa uhya ni welekwa wa Hasena. Waika iziboliti zakwe, niyo waika izinyivi zakwe ne imihindo ya chuma. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Hantu hatimile hazengwa ni Malemoti mwana ywa Uliya mwezukulu ywa Hakosi. Atimile ni Meshulamu mwanawe dya Belekiya mwezukulu ywa Meshezabeli. Atimile ni Zadoki mwana ywa Baana kazenga uhya hantu hatimile. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Hantu hatimile hazengwa uhya ni wantu walaile Tekowa, mna vilongozi wawo walemela kudamanya ndima wenkigwe wakachimailwa ni masekulu wawo. <verse eid="NEH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Inchili ikwitangwa ya Chikale izengwa uhya ni Yoyada mwana ywa Pasea na Meshulamu mwana ywa Besodeya. Niyo waika iziboliti zakwe ne izinyivi ne ivipete ne imihindo. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Wawatimile awo mwe indima iyo yo kuzenga uhya wendaga Melatiya kulawa Gibeoni na Yadoni kulawa Melonoti hamwenga na wantu wo mzi wa Gibeoni na Mizipa, wantu awo wendaga wakalongozwa ni chilongozi ywo mkowa wa ntendele yo uswelo wa zuwa yomto wa Efulati. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Intendele itimle yazengagwa ni Uzieli mwana ywa Halihaya mta kusana zahabu, intendele itimile kubula kwe ichiwambaza chizangalamu chazengagwa uhya ni Hananiya, mta kudamanya mavuta yakupwepweleka. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Lefaya mwana ywa Huli, chilongozi nakalongoza inusu yo umzi wa Yelusalemu kazenga uhya hantu hatimile. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Yedaya mwana ywa Halumafu azengile uhya intendele ikusinyana ne inyumbakwe. Hatushi mwana ywa Hashabuneya kazenga uhya ahantu hatimile. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Malikiya mwana ywa Halimu na Hashubu mwana ywa Pahati Moabu wazenga uhya muntu mtimile hamwenga na Umnala wa Tanuli dya kokela mikate. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Shalumu mwana ywa Haloheshi, chilongozi ywe inusu yo umzi wa Yelusalemu kazenga uhya ntendele zitimile akambizana na wanachiche wakwe. <verse eid="NEH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Inchili ya Kwedikolongo izengwa uhya ni Hanuni na awekazi wo umzi wa Zanoa. Wazenga uhya na kwika izinyivi ne vipete ne imihindo hantu hakwe. Iviya wazenga uhya ichiwambaza china utali wa futi elufu imwenga na magana mashano kubula Kwenchili ye Idizalazala. <verse eid="NEH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Inchili ye Idizalazala izengwa uhya ni Makaya mwana ywa Lekabu chilongozi ywa Beti Hakelemu. Kazenga uhya na kwika izinyivi zakwe ne ivipete ne mihindo yo kuvugaila inchili. <verse eid="NEH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Inchili ye Sokwe izengwa uhya ni Shalumu mwana ywa Kolihoze chilongozi ywe wilaya ya Misipa. Kazenga uhya Inchili iyo yo kwingilila niyo aihanga na kwika izinyivi zakwe ne iziboliti zakwe ne imihindo hantu hakwe. Iviya kazenga uhya ichiwambaza che Idibwawasi dya Silo hajihi ne idikonde dya seuta kubula kwezintantilo zikuseleza kulawa komzi wa seuta Daudi. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Hantu hatimile, izengwa uhya ni Nehemiya mwana ywa Azibuki chilongozi ywe inusu ye wilaya ya Beti Zuli kubula hantu hakusinyana ne izimbila za Daudi, kubula kwedibwawa didamanywe na kubula Kwenyumba ya Wakankalu.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wadamanye ndima mwechiwambaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Hantu hatimile, hazengwa uhya ni Walawi wakalongozwa ni Lehumu mwana ywa Bani. Hashabiya chilongozi ywe inusu ye wilaya ya Keila, kajendeleza kuzenga uhya hantu hatimile kwachausa cha wantu we iwilaya yakwe. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Hadya ahele, hantu hatimile kuzengwa uhya hazengwa ni walukolo wawo wakachimailwa ni Binui mwana ywa Henadadi, chilongozi ywe inusu ye wilaya ya Keila. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Hantu hatimile kuzengwa uhya hazengagwa ni Ezeli mwana ywa Yeshua chilongozi ywa Misipa, kazenga uhya muntu mtimile kukongela hadya ahantu hakusinyana ne ikweza ikuhinga kwenyumba yo kwikiya viziha kubula kwe mpembe ye chiwambaza. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Hantu hatimile kukongela kwe impembe kubula ko lwivi lwa Eliashibu mlavyantambiko mkulu hazengwa ni Baluki mwana ywa Zabai. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Hantu hatimile, Melemoti mwana ywa Uliya mwezukulu ywa Hakosi kazenga uhya muntu mtimile kukongela henchili ye iyumba ya Eliyashibu kubula uhelo we inyumba iyo.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walavyantambiko wazengile ichiwambaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Hantu hatimile kuzengwa uhya hazengwa ni walavyantambiko walaile ntendele zizunguluke umzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Awo wakaheza, Benjamini na Hashubu wazenga uhya hantu hakusinyana ne izinyumba zawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:23">Azaliya mwana ywa Maseya mwezukulu ywa Ananiya kazenga uhya hajihi ne inyumbakwe. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Hantu hatimile, hazengwa uhya ni Binui mwana ywa Henadadi kakongela kwenyumba ya Azaliya kubula kwempembe ye ichiwambaza. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Vikaheza, Palali mwana ywa Uzai kazenga uhya kukongela he impembe ye ichiwambaza kubula ko mnala wa kulanga ukulagisa idizumba dye chiseuta hampezo ho uwa wa awamizi. Hantu hatimile, hazengwa uhya ni Pedaya mwana ywa Paloshi, <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />hamwenga na awandima we Inyumba ya Chohile wakwikala kulanga kwenkweza ya Ofeli wazenga uhya kubula hantu hakusinyana ne Inchili ya Amazi kuhinga ulailo wa zuwa hamwenga na udya umnala usolokele.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazesi watuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Hantu hatuhu hatimile, wantu kulawa Tekoa wahazenga uhya kukongela ko mnala usolokele kubula kwechiwambaza cha Ofeli. <verse eid="NEH 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Walavyantambiko wazenga uhya mwe Inchili ye Izifalasi, chila yumwenga kulongozi kwenyumbakwe. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Awo weze wajike, Sadoki mwana ywa Imeli kazenga uhya hantu hakutimila hakusinyana ne inyumbakwe. Hantu hatimile kuzengwa uhya hazengwa ni Shemaya mwana ywa Shekaniya mwamizi ywe Inchili ya ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Hantu hatuhu hatimile hazengwa uhya ni Hananiya mwana ywa Shelemia na Hanuni mwana ywa mtandatu ywa Salafu. Awo waze waheze, Meshulamu mwana ywa Belekiya kazenga uhya hantu hakutimila hakusinyana ne inyumbakwe akwikala. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Hantu hatimile, makaya msana zahabu kazenga uhya kubula kwe izinyumba za Wanetini na wataga mayombe, hakusinyana ne Inchili yo Kulaula kubula kwechumba chikulanga kwempembe ye chiwambaza. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Hantu ho uhelo kukongela kwechumba mwe mpembe kubula kwa Inchili ye Izingoto hazengagwa uhya ni wasana zahabu na wataga mayombe.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiya ahuda uhigani mo uzesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Sanibalati eze eve kugamba suwe Wayahudi chazenga uhya ichiwamabaza niyo ehiwa vitendese vyaleka akonga kuchitila. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Akatenda ekulongozi kwa wambuyaze na wagomba nkondo wa Wasamaliya, akagamba, “Wano Wayahudi wasokele watenda bwani? Togola nawadahe kuzenga uhya ichiwambaza chawo? Togola wafanyanya kugamba kwa kulavya ntambiko nawabinde kuzenga kwa zuwa dimwenga? Togola nawadahe kufukula mayuwe kulawa mwe visungu vya makalankala?” <verse eid="NEH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Tobiya kulawa kwe idikabila dya Amoni nendile kachimala hampezo ha Sanibalati niyo agamba, “Icho wakuzenga hata uzi dinakwela mlanga mwakwe nadikadaha kugwisa ichiwambaza chawo!” <verse eid="NEH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Niyo namlombeza Chohile, “Weye Chohile ywetu uchive, kwaviya chibelwa. Wavuzize amahuluto yawo yawawiye wenye. Walavye chani wegalwe kweisi yo usamizo. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Usekuwalekeila wihi wawo naho usekujala amasa yawo kwaviya wawahuluta awazesi kulongozi kwako!” <verse eid="NEH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Ivyo niyo chazenga ichiwambaza kubula mwe inusu yo utali we ichimo chakwe, kwaviya wantu wadamanya ndima kwa myoyo yawo yose. <verse eid="NEH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Mna umo Sanibalati na Tobiya na Walabu na Waamoli na wantu wa Ashidodi weze weve kugamba kuzengwa uhya iviwambaza vyomzi wa Yelusalemu nendile ukajendeleza na mudya mbogozoke msitwa niyo wehiwa vitendese. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Wose niyo walafya chahamwenga weze watowane na awekazi wa Yelusalemu na kuhosa wasekwivana. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Mna niyo chamlombeza Chohile ywetu na kwika wantu wamile ichiwambaza chilo na msi chani chiwachinde. <verse eid="NEH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Wantu wa Yuda niyo wachema nchemo wagamba, “Udahi wa awandima uhunguka, makalankala nayo yalozesa elo hachikudaha kuzenga uhya ichiwambaza.” <verse eid="NEH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Wankondo wetu niyo wakagamba, “Hawadahe kumanya hegu kuwona kubula aho nachibule kwawo na kuwakoma na kuchinda indima iyo.” <verse eid="NEH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Vikaheza, Wayahudi wendile wakekala haguhi nawo niyo weza chila nkanana kuchilangiliza wachigamba, “Naweze kulawa chila hantu wakwikala na kuchebebunga!” <verse eid="NEH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Ivyo niyo naika wantu wamile mudya umuntu ichiwambaza hechinati kusila, siwaika kutimilana na nkolo zawo, wakatenda na mabamba yawo na maguha na nyuta na mifulo. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Nize niwone wantu wengilwa ni nkama, niyo nachimala nawagamba wakulu na masekulu na wantu watuhu wose, “Msekuwogoha. Ikani msuhi kwa Zumbe uyo ni mkulu mta kogofya. Gombani nkondo kwachausa cha walukolo wenyu na wana wenyu na wanachiche wenyu na wavyele wenyu na izinyumba zenyu.” <verse eid="NEH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Wankondo wetu weze weve kugamba chibunkula umwalo wawo na kugamba Chohile kazaganya umwalo wawo, suwe chose niyo chauya kwechiwambaza, chila mntu hendima yakwe. <verse eid="NEH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Kukongela zuwa diya na kujendeleza inusu ya awantu wangu wadamanya ndima yo uzesi ne inusu ya intuhu nawatoza maguha na uta na nchingo za mwevifuwa. Masekulu nendile wakawakondagiza wantu wose wa Yuda, <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />wendile wakazenga ichiwambaza. Wadya wendile wenula ivimpandwa vyo kuzengela wadamanya ndima yawo kwa mkono umwenga na mkono umtuhu watoza chiziha. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Chila mzesi nendile kenyinyi chiziha ntendele imwenga kuno adamanya ndima, yudya mntu akuvila idigunda nendile kekala hamwenga na miye. <verse eid="NEH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Vikaheza niyo nawagamba wakulu na masekulu wa wantu watuhu wose, “Ndima ino ikulisa naho yenela chila hantu, suwe naswi chizagala chila mntu ehale na mnyawe. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Hegu mneva izwi dya gunda soni mwechisanye hamwenga na suwe, Chohile nagombe nkondo kwachausa chetu!” <verse eid="NEH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Ivyo, chijendeleza kudamanya ndima, nusu ya wantu watoza maguha kukongela kukacha kubula kagogoza ntondo zawoneka. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Ichipindi icho, niyo nawagamba wantu, “Chila mntu na mwambizi ywakwe nechilo wekale komzi wa Yelusalemu, kwa kudamanya ivyo nawatende wamizi nechilo na nomsi wadamanye ndima.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Elo, miye hegu walukolo wangu hegu wandima wangu hegu wamizi nendile nawo hahana ahambule suche yakwe. Chila yumwenga nendile anachiziha chakwe hata akaita kwekuteka mazi.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiya ambiza wachiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Nyumani niyo kwalaila mafuzumo mgati mwa wantu, wagosi kwa wavyele wawafuzumila walukolo wawo watuhu Wayahudi. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Wakagamba, “China wana walozese. Ivyo chaunga nkande ilozize chani chidye chijendeleze kwikala.” <verse eid="NEH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Watuhu wagamba, “Chaika lahani izinkonde zetu ne imizabibu yetu ne izinyumba zetu chani chipate nkande chipindi cha gumbo chinase kubanika.” <verse eid="NEH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Watuhu wakagamba, “Chaungwa chikope hela chani chilihe kodi ya seuta kwachausa che izinkonde zetu ne imizabibu yetu. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Suwe Chiwayahudi saviya weli wowo, wana wetu ni watana saviya wana wawo, mna chaungwa chiwalavye wanetu awamwenga wakatende watumwa. Wachiche weyu awamwenga watenda kale watumwa, mna hachina udahi wa kuchinda imbuli iyo kwaviya nkonde zetu ne imizabibu yetu viguhigwa vitenda ugoli wa watuhu.” <verse eid="NEH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Nize nive indilo na amafuzumo yawo niyo nemukwa ni maya vitendese. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Niyo nalungumula mwe izifanyanyi zangu, nawakwahila wakulu na masekulu nawagamba, “Ni mbwani mkuwazila walukolo wenyu kwa kuwatoza chongezeko!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:7">Ivyo niyo naduganya mdugano mkulu chani niwausize inkunto yawo, <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />niyo nagamba, “Kwa udahi wetu chiwakombola walukolo wetu Wayahudi watahigwe kwesi ntuhu. Mna haluse nyuwe mwawataga walukolo wenyu chiwagule suwe!” Masekulu niyo wanyamala dwii hawana dya kulonga. <verse eid="NEH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Ivyo niyo najendeleza kulonga, “Dino mkudamanya diha. Timilani viya Chohile ywetu akulonga chani chenege kulongwa vihiye ni wankondo wetu wantu we izisi ntuhu. <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Miye na walukolo wangu na wantu wangu chawakopeshe wantu hela na nkande hehena chongezeko. Nyuwe nanywi mbuli ya kutoza chongezeko ilekeni! <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Sunguzani wavuzizeni izinkonde zawo ne imizabibu yawo ne izinkonde zawo ze imizaituni ne izinyumba zawo, iviya ichongezeko chawo che izihela ne inkande ne idivai impya na amavuta viya mwatozize.” <verse eid="NEH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Niyo wagamba, “Nachiwavuzize, naho hachunge chintu chochose nachongezeke kulawa kwawo. Nachidamanye seivyo ulongile.” Haheza niyo nawetanga walavyantambiko na kuwagamba wadya wakulu na masekulu welise kudamanya chiya walongile. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Iviya niyo nakung'unta umsipi we izisuche zangu na kugamba, “Mntu yoyose hanadamanye icheliso chino, Chohile amkung'unte savino mwe inyumba yakwe na mwe indima yakwe. Chani atende hana chintu!” Mdugano wose niyo wagamba, “Taile” Wamtunya Zumbe. Awo niyo wadamanya saviya welisize.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wedi wa Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Kukongela chipindi nikigwe nitende sekulu mwe isi ya Yuda kwa mihilimo mlongo na midi, kugamba kukongela mhilimo wa milongo midi kubula mhilimo wa milongo mitatu na midi yo usekulu wa seuta Atashasita, sajezaga kudya nkande ikuwagila kudigwa ni sekulu, hata walukolo wangu hawadamanye seivyo. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Mna masekulu we nkongo wadya wanilongwele wawegamila wantu na kuguha kulawa mwawo vihande vya mayuwe ya chumbu vikubula milongo mine chila zuwa hamwenga na nkande na divai. Iviya wambizi wawo wapata luhenyo lwa kuwadidimiza wantu. Mna miye sidamanye ivyo kwaviya namtunya Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Sihikiliza kudamanya ndima mwe ichiwambaza chino. Wantu wangu wose wadugana aho chani wadamanye ndima ya kuzenga ichiwambaza, hachiguhile nkonde yoyose. <verse eid="NEH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Ukaleka ayo, Wayahudi gana dimwenga na milongo mishano na masekulu nendile wakadya hemeza yangu, hamwenga na wantu wezile kulawa kwe izisi ntuhu zihaguhi. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Chila zuwa chidya njeku imwenga na ngoto mtandatu zidamane na nguku. Chila yakomboka mazuwa mlongo umwenga nalavyaga divai ilozize. Ukaleka ayo kwaviya wantu nendile wazamilwa, sungile nilihwe maliho yakumuwagila sekulu.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Weye Chohile ywangu usekunijala, nikumbuka mo wedi wangu kwa mbuli zose nidamanye kwachausa cha wano awantu.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s">Mzungu wa kumkoma Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Sanibalati na Tobiya na mwalabu akwitangwa Geshemu na wankondo wetu watuhu weze weve kugamba chibindiliza kuzenga uhya ichiwambaza na naho hahana hantu hohose hasigale, ukaleka nyivi nizodu zisigale kwikwa mwe izinchili zo umwingilo, <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanibalati na Geshemu niyo wanigaila ulosi wanigamba, “Soo chidugane mwe kaya imwe na imwe mweisi ye idibwandasi ya Ono.” Mna nawekamba vileke wanilumize. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Elo, niyo nasigila walosi nawagamba, “Ndima hudamanya ikulisa haikulekeka, sikudaha kwiza kwenyu nneza uko indima naichimale.”<verse eid="NEH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Wanigaila ulosi sauwo nkanana nne na chila nkanana siwahitula saviya nihitule nkongo. <verse eid="NEH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Elo, nkanana ya shano, Sanibalati niyo amsigila mwambizi ywakwe kwangu anigaila baluwa heifungigwe ikudaha kusomwa ni mntu yoyose, <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />baluwa iyo iwandikwa vino, Geshemu anigamba, “Mbuli zenela mwe izisi zose, ni chindedi kugamba weye na Wayahudi mwadamanya mwalo wa kuhitukila, nivyo vikuleka mwazenga chiwambaza. Ukaleka ayo kuligana na ulosi uno weye waunga wetende seuta ywawo, <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />naho kusagula waoni watowe lugong'ondo kukulanga weye uko Yelusalemu, kugamba, weye Nehemiya wi seuta uko Yuda! Haluse ulosi uno nagambilwe seuta Atashasita, elo soo chilafye chahamwenga.” <verse eid="NEH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Niyo namhitula namgamba, “Mbuli ukulonga sicho chindedi, mna walonga vikulawa mo mtwi wako.”<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Wose nawakajeza kuchitisa wakafanyanya kugamba, wantu nawogohe hawadahe kudamanya ndima, ivyo ndima haisile. Mna niyo nalombeza, “Weye Chohile nijela nguvu!”<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Zuwa dimwenga niyo naita kunyumba kwa Shemaya mwana ywa Delaya mwezukulu ywa Mehetabeli, uyo endaga kafungwa mndani mwe inyumbakwe. Niyo agamba, “Chidugane kwenyumba ya Chohile mndani mwe inyumba yo kumvikila Chohile chivugale izinyivi zakwe chefise, kwaviya wantu naweze wakukome. Chindedi nechilo naweze wakukome.”<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Niyo nagamba, “Togola mntu samiye nisumke? Hegu mntu samiye nite kwe Inyumba ya Chohile nihonye wikazi wangu? Sanikwite!”<verse eid="NEH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Nasibunkula kugamba Chohile hamsigile, mna Tobiya na Sanibalati wamfumbasa anigambile ivyo. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Nendile kafumbaswa anitise nidamanye mbuli iyo nikole masa, wakaheza wabalange idizina dyangu na kunitende nibelwe ni wantu.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Silombeza hagamba, “Weye Chohile ywangu usekujala kuwakantila Tobiya na Sanibalati kwa mbuli wadamanye, naho usekumjala Naodiya muoni ywa chiche na waoni watuhu wajezize kunitisa.”<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndima yabindilikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Mwe idizuwa dya milongo midi na shano dyo mwezi wa Eluli, nuwo mwezi wa mlongo ndima yo kuzenga ichiwambaza niyo yabindilikila. Ndima iyo idamanyika kwa mazuwa milongo mishano na mbili <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Wankondo wetu wose mwe izisi zose zichizunguluke weze weve ulosi uwo niyo wogoha na kuhuza, kwaviya wabunkula kugamba ndima ino idamanyika kwa wambizi wa Chohile ywetu.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Naho mwa amazuwa ayo wakulu wa Yuda nendile wakawandikilana baluwa zilozize na Tobiya. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Wantu walozize mweisi ya Yuda nawelunga na Tobiya, kwaviya endaga mkwewe dya Shekaniya mwana ywa Ala. Iviya mwanawe akwitangwa Yehohanani amsolaga mchiche ywa Meshulamu mwana ywa Belekiya. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Ukaleka ayo nendile wakanitamwila mbuli zedi za Tobiya ne izimbuli zangu nendile wakamwigaila. Tobiya naye niyo anigaila baluwa za kuntisa.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Elo, ichiwambaza chize chiheze kuzengwa uhya na kujela izinchili, niyo wasagulwa wamizi we izinchili na wachemi na Walawi wenkigwa ndima za kudamanya. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Sisagula wantu waidi watende vilongozi wo umzi wa Yelusalemu, mlukolo ywangu Hanani hamwenga na Hananiya sekulu ywa wata kwamila ingome, kwaviya endaga mkanuni naho amvikila Chohile kujinka watuhu walozize. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Niyo nawagamba, “Izinchili za Yelusalemu msekuzivugula chilo chose kubula mtondo zuwa dikwela. Wamizi we izinchili wakatenda mwendima yawo wavugale izinchili na kujela mihindo umo hewenati kuhalawa. Iviya sagulani wekazi wo umzi wa Yelusalemu watende wamizi, chila yumwenga hantu hakwe na watuhu wazungulukile hajihi ne izinyumba zawo wenye.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludongo lwa awantu wawiye kulawa ko usamizo.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EZR 2:1-70">Ezila 2:1-70</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Umzi wa Yelusalemu nendile ni mkulu na wangalamka, mna wantu wendile weyumo mndani ni wajeche, izinyumba nazo nendile hazinati kuzengwa. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Chohile ywangu niyo aninka fanyanyi mo moyo wangu niwachisanye wakulu na masekulu na wantu watuhu chani wadongelekwe kuligana na nkolo zawo. Sibwila chitabu chiwandikwe ludongo lwa vyeleko viwandikwe mazina ya wadya wawiye nkongo kulawa ko usamizo. Ludongo lwa amazina ayo ni yano,, <verse eid="NEH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />wano ni wantu wawiye kulawa ko usamizo wasamizwe na kwigalwa ni seuta Nebukadineza ywa Babeli, wauya kwemizi ya Yelusalemu na Yuda chila mntu komzi wakwe, <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />wakatenda walongozwa ni Zelubabeli na Yoshuwa na Nehemiya na Azaliya na Lamiya na Nahamani na Modekai na Bilishani na Misipeleti na Bigwai na Nehumu na Baana. Ukutimila ni mligano wa ludongo lwa wantu wa nkolo za Izulaeli wawiye kulaw ko usamizo.<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Ludongo lwa wantu wa Izulaeli, welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Paloshi ni wantu elufu mbili gana dimwenga milongo mfungate na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Shefatiya ni wantu magana matatu milongo mfungate na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Ala ni wantu magana mtandatu milongo mishano na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Welekwa wa Pahati Moabu kujinkila kwezinkolo za Yoshuwa na Yoabu ni wantu elufu mbili magana mnane mlongo umwenga na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukoo lwa Elamu ni wantu elufu imwenga magana maidi milongo mishano na wane <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Zatu ni wantu magana mnane milongo mine na washano. <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Zakai ni wantu magana mfungate na milongo mtandatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Binui ni wantu magana mtandatu milongo mine na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Bebai ni wantu magana mtandantu milongo midi na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Azigadi ni wantu elufu mbili magana matatu milongo midi na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Adonikamu ni wantu magana mtandatu milongo mtandatu na mfungate. <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Bigwai ni wantu elufu mbili milongo mtandatu na mfungate. <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Adini ni wantu magana mtandatu milongo mishano na washano. <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Welekwa wa Ateli, zina dyakwe tuhu etangwa Hezekiya ni wantu milongo chenda na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Hashumu ni wantu magana matatu milongo midi na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Besai ni wantu magana matatu na milongo midi na wane. <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Halifu ni wantu gana dimwenga mlongo umwenga na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Gibeoni ni wantu milongo chenda na washano <verse eid="NEH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Iviya wantu wadya wakale wawo wekalaga mwe mizi ya Betelehemu na Netofa wauyaga wantu gana dimwenga milongo mnane na mnane <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Kulawa komzi wa Anatoti wauya wantu gana dimwenga milongo midi na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Komzi wa Beti Azimaweti wauya wantu milongo mine na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Kwemizi ya Kiliyati Yealimu na Kefila na Beloti wauya wantu magana mfungate milongo mine na watatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Kwemizi ya Lama na Geba wauya wantu magana mtandatu na milongo midi na yumwenga. <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Kmzi wa Mikimashi wauya wantu gana dimwenga milongo midi na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Kwemizi ya Beteli na Ai wauya wantu gana dimwenga milongo midi na watatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Komzi mtuhu wa Nebo wauya wantu milongo mishano na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Komzi mtuhu wa Elamu wauya wantu elufu imwenga magana maidi milongo mishano na wane. <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Komzi wa Halimu wauya wantu magana matatu na milongo midi. <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Komzi wa Yeliko wauya wantu magana matatu milongo mine na washano. <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Kwemizi ya Lodi Hadidi na Ono wauya wantu magana mfungate milongo midi na yumwenga. <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Komzi wa Senaa wauya wantu elufu ntatu magana chenda na milongo mitatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Ludongo lwa walavyantambiko wawiye kulawa ko usamizo. Welekwa wa Yedaya, kugamba wantu we ikaya ya Yeshuwa wendaga wantu magana chenda milongo mfungate na watatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Welekwa mo lukolo lwa Imeli ni wantu elufu imwenga milongo mishano na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Welekwa mo lukolo lwa Pashuli ni wantu elufu imwenga magana maidi milongo mine na mfungate. <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Welekwa kulawa mo lukolo lwa Halimu ni wantu elufu imwenga mlongo umwenga na mfungate. <verse eid="NEH 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Walawi wawiye wo ulukolo lwa Yeshuwa na Kadimeli welekwa wa Hodaviya wendaga wantu milongo mfungate na wane. <verse eid="NEH 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Wachemi welekwa wa Asafu ni wantu gana dimwenga milongo mine na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Wamizi we izinchili ze Inyumba ya Chohile we izinkolo za Shalumu na Ateli na Talimoni na Akubu na Hatita na Shobai wauya wantu gana dimwenga milongo mitatu na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Nkolo za wandima we Inyumba ya Chohile wawiye wendaga ni welekwa kulawa mwa wano wantu, lukolo lwa Siha na lukolo lwa Hasufa na lukolo lwa Taboati. <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />Lukolo lwa Kelosi na lukolo lwa Siya na lukolo lwa Padoni. <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />Lukolo lwa Lebana na lukolo lwa Hagaba na lukolo lwa Shalimai. <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />Lukolo lwa Hanani na lukolo lwa Gideli na lukolo lwa Gahali. <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />Lukolo lwa Leaya na lukolo lwa Lesini na lukolo lwa Nekoda. <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />Lukolo lwa Gazamu na lukolo lwa Uza na lukolo lwa Paseya. <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />Lukolo lwa Besai na lukolo lwa Meunimu na lukolo lwa Nefusimu. <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />Lukolo lwa Bakibuki na lukolo lwa Hakufa na lukolo lwa Halihuli. <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />Lukolo lwa Basiluti na lukolo lwa Mehida na lukolo lwa Halisha. <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />Lukolo lwa Balikosi na lukolo lwa Sisela na lukolo lwa Tema. <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />Lukolo lwa Nesiya na lukolo lwa Hatifa. <verse eid="NEH 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Lukolo lwa wandima wa seuta Sulemani wawiye kulawa ko usamizo ni lukolo lwa Sotai na lukolo lwa Sofeleti na lukolo lwa Pelida. <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />Lukolo lwa Yaala na lukolo lwa Dalikoni na lukolo lwa Gideli. <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />Lukolo lwa Shefatiya na lukolo lwa Hatili na lukolo lwa Pokeleti Hazebaimu na lukolo lwa Amoni.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Wose chahamwenga wandima mwe Inyumba yo Chohile na lukolo lwa wandima wa seuta Sulemani wendaga wantu magana matatu milongo chenda na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Wantu wano nawo wawiye kulawa kwe imizi ya, Teli Mela na Teli Hasha na Kelubu na Adoni na Imeli, mna vidundugika kubunkulwa kugamba ni welekwa wa Waizulaeli, <verse eid="NEH 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Welekwa wa Delaya na lukolo lwa Tobiya na lukolo lwa Nekoda, chahamwenga ni wantu magana mtandatu milongo mine na mbili.<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Walavyantambiko kulawa mwe izinkolo za Hobaya na Hakosi na Balizilai, iviya wauyaga. Balizilai asolaga mchiche kulawa mwa welekwa wa Balizilai komzi wa Giliyadi, ivyo niyo aguha idizina dye idikolwa dya mkaziwe <verse eid="NEH 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Wantu awo walondwa amazina yawo mwe ludongo lwa wakale wawo, mna amazina ye izinkolo zawo hayaoneke, ivyo hawazumilike kutenda mwe ndima zo ulavyantambiko kwaviya hawakuzumilika kulongozi kwa Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Ivyo sekulu ywa Wayahudi niyo alagiza kugamba awantu awo wasekudya nkande ilavigwe kwa Chohile kubula watenda na mlavyantambiko akunga ajeseze mayuwe ya Ulimu na Sumimu chani wamanye ivyo Chohile akunga. <verse eid="NEH 7:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Wantu wose wawiye kulawa ko usamizo wendaga elufu milongo mine na mbili magana matatu na milongo mtandatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />Iviya kwendaga na wandima wachilume na wachiche elufu mfungate magana matatu milongo mitatu na mfungate, naho kwendaga na wachemi wachilume na wachiche magana maidi milongo mine na washano. <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Kwendaga na falasi magana mfungate milongo mitatu na mtandatu na mpunda falasi magana maidi milongo mine na shano. <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />Ngamiya magana mane milongo mitatu na shano na mpunda elufu mtandatu magana mfungate na milongo midi. <verse eid="NEH 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Wakulu wa nkolo wasiku wambiza indima yo uzesi. Mkulu wo umkowa kenkiza chilo mnane za zahabu na bakuli milongo mishano za kujeseza kuzenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile na suche magana mashano na milongo mitatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Wakulu wa nkolo wasiku wenkiza chilo za zahabu gana dimwenga milongo mtandatu na mnane na chilo elufu imwenga magana maidi na milongo mishano za mayuwe ya chumbu kwachausa cho uzesi. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Vintu vyose walavize wantu watuhu vyendaga ni chilo za zahabu gana dimwenga milongo mtandatu na mnane na chilo gana dimwenga na milongo mine za mayuwe ya chumbu na suche za walavyantambiko milongo mtantatu na mfungate.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Ivyo, walavyantambiko na Walawi na wamizi we izinchili na wachemi na wandima mwe Inyumba ya Chohile na wantu wasiku watuhu na Waizulaeli wose wauya na kwikala mwe imizi yawo.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s">Ezila awasomela wantu Sigilizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Mo mwezi wa mfungate wantu wose wa Izulaeli nendile wakekala mwe imizi yawo. Vikaheza kwa niya imwenga, niyo wechisanya komzi wa Yelusalemu mwe chiwasa chihajihi ne Inchili ya Amazi. Niyo wamgamba Ezila, uyo mhinya sigilizi naho mlavyantambiko alete ichitabu che Isigilizi ya Musa iyo Chohile alagize kwachausa cha Waizulaeli. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Ezila niyo egala ichitabu che Isigilizi kulongozi komdugano wendile wadugana wagosi na wavyele na wana wendile wakadaha kumanya mbuli zikulongwa. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Ezila niyo awasomela ichitabu che isigilizi ya Musa akatenda kulungozi kwe Inchili ya Amazi, kukongela mtondo kubula nomsi. Wantu wose wetegelezesa icho chiwandikwe mwe ichitabu icho che Isigilizi. <verse eid="NEH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Ezila kachimala mlanga mwe chilingo chizengigwe kwachausa che imbuli iyo. Haguhi naye ntendele ya kulume nendile wachimala Matitiya na Shema na Anaya na Uliya na Hilikiya na Maaseya. Ntendele ya kumuso nendile wachimala Pedaya na Mishaeli na Milikiya na Hashumu na Hashibadani na Zekaliya na Meshulamu.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Ezila kachimala mlanga mwe ichilingo icho, ivyo kenukila kujinka wantu wose vyaleka wamuwona. Umo akagubula ichitabu che Isigilizi wantu wose niyo wachimala. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Ezila kamtogola Zumbe Chohile mkulu, wantu wose niyo wenula imikono kulanga weketikila, “Taile! Taile!” Wakaheza niyo wafika madi na kumvikila Zumbe vinengo vyawo vikatenda viduma mwe isanga.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Weze wachimale Walawi wano wakutimila nendile wakawevilikiza wantu idya Isigilizi. Mazina yawo ni Yesuwa na Bani na Shelebiya na Jamini na Akubu na Shebatai na Hodai na Maseya na Kelita na Azaliya na Yozabadi na Hanani na Pelaya. Watenda ivyo chila yumwenga akatenda kachimala hantu hakwe. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Wasoma kulawa mwe chiya Ichitabu che Isigilizi ya Chohile wakaitambalisa na kuwevilikiza wantu niyo wadaha kukombaganya chiya chisomigwe. <verse eid="NEH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Wantu wose weze weve viya Isigilizi ikunga niyo wakonga kwila. Aho, Nehemiya uyo endile chilongozi na Ezila mlavyantambiko na mta kuwandika hamwenga na Walawi nendile wakatapita kwa wantu icho nachikalongwa, niyo wawagamba wantu wose, “Zuwa dino dikuka kwa Zumbe Chohile ywenyu. Msekulomboleza hegu kwila.” <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Nehemiya niyo awagamba, “Hitani kwezikaya zenyu mkatekubweda nkande zibukile mwile na kunywa vimwile, na ivimwenga wegaile wadya hewena chochose cha kudya. Zuwa dino dikuka kwa Zumbe Chohile. Msekwezimatila kwaviya mbwedo nawenkeni Zumbe nauwatogezeni.”<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Walawi niyo wawabasa wantu wose wawanyamaza wawagamba, “Mtondowale, kwaviya dino ni zuwa dikukule. Msekwezimatila.” <verse eid="NEH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Ivyo, wantu wose niyo wahalawa waita wakudya na kunywa na kuwegaila nkande wadya hewena, wakaheza wavina kwa chinyemi chikulu, kwaviya wamanya imilosi idya wagambilwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasu ya makumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Zuwa ditimile wakulu wa nkolo zose, hamwenga na walavyantambiko na Walawi, niyo wadugana wamzunguluka Ezila mta kuwandika chani wahine imilosi ye Isigilizi. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Niyo wabunkula kugamba Chohile amlagizaga Musa kugamba wantu wa Izulaeli waungwa wekale mwe makumbi mwe ngasu yo mwezi wa mfungate. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Ivyo niyo watambalise ulosi uno wenele mwemizi yawo na Yelusalemu wakagamba, “Hitani ko lugulu mkakante miti ya misiga na mizaituni mbago na mitende na miti ya muituyhu chani mdamanye makumbi kuligana na viya viwandikwe mwe Isigilizi.”<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Elo, wantu niyo waita wakuguha matambi na kuzenga makumbi mlanga mo uwala we izinyumba zawo na mwezinyuwa zawo na mo uwa we Inyumba ya Chohile na hechiwasa hajihi ne Nchili ya Mwingilo ya Amazi ne Nchili ya Mwingilo ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Wantu wose wa Izulaeli wawiye kulawa ko usamizo niyo wazenga makumbi na kwikala umo mndani. Ino yendaga nkanana ya nkongo ngasu iyo kuvinwa seivyo kukongela amazuwa ya Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni kubula zuwa idyo. Waizulaeli hawajezaga kudamanya seivyo wadamanye mwe iyo. Wantu naweleleswa. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Chila zuwa, kukongela zuwa dya nkongo dye ingasu kubula dyo uhelo, Ezila kasoma mwe Ichitabu che Isigilizi ya Chohile. Ngasu iyo waivina kwa mazuwa mfungate na zuwa dya mnane kwendaga na mdugano wa kubindiliza ingasu saviya vilagizwe mwe isigilizi.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Izulaeli weila amasa yawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Mwe idizuwa dya milongo midi na nne dyo umwezi udya wa mfungate, Waizulaeli nendile wadugana hamwenga wakafunga na kuvika suche za majuniya kuno wekupuila malumbi kwemitwi yawo kulagisa usungu kwachausa cha amasa yawo. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wepagula kulawa mwa awantu sawo Wayahudi. Niyo wachimala hantu hawo na kweila amasa yawo na wihi wa wakale wawo. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Wasoma izisigilizi ziwandikwe mwe ichitabu cha Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo kwa masa matatu na masa matatu matuhu yatimile wayajeseza kweila amasa yawo na kumvikila Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo.<verse eid="NEH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Kwendaga na chilingo cha Walawi wachimale, awo wendaga ni Yeshuwa na Bani na Kadimeli na Shebaniya na Bani na Shelabiya na Bani ywa kaidi na Keneni. Awo wamlombeza Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo kwa izwi kulu.<verse eid="NEH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Ivyo, vilongozi wa Walawi, Yeshuwa na Kadimeli na Bani na Hashabuneya na Shelabiya na Hodiya na Shebaniya na Petahiya niyo wawetanga awantu na kuwagamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">“Chimalani mumtogole Zumbe Chohile ywenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">mtogoleni uyo mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">Ditogoleni idizina dyakwe dikukile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">Hata hegu hahana mntu akudaha kumtogola viya vikungwa.”<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya kweila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Ezila niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">“Weye Zumbe ni weyedu Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">umbile ulanga ne imbingu hamwenga ne izintondo zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">isi ne ivintu vyose vimndani mwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">ibahali ne ivintu vyose vimndani mwakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">Weye wenkiza ujima kwa vyumbe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">wandima wose wa kwembingu wakuvikila weye.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Weye Zumbe Chohile umsagule Abulamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">na kumlavya komzi wa Uli ya Wakalidayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">niyo wamwinka zina tuhu dya Bulahimu.<verse eid="NEH 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Kumuwona ni mkanuni kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">weye niyo wadamanya lagano naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">kugamba awelekwa wakwe nowenke isi ya Wakanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">neisi ya Wahiti neisi ya Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">neisi ya Wapelizi neisi ya Wayebusi neisi ya Wagiligashi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">Niyo wadichintiza kwaviya weye wimkanuni.”<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />“Wawonaga amasulumizo ya awakale wetu uko kweisi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:9">Wevaga idizwi dyawo umo wakwitangaga uwambize uko kwebahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="NEH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Kudamanya vilagiso vya mpituko na maula kwa Falao chilongozi ywa Misili na masekulu wa awandima wakwe na awantu wose we isi yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">kwaviya wamanyaga ivyo Wamisili wawasulumize awantu wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">Ulailo wakwe wantu wose wakumanya kubula dyelo.<verse eid="NEH 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Kupagula haidi ibahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">kulongozi kwawo vileke wajinke hantu hanyaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">mna Wamisili wendile wakawatimila wamelwa ni mazi mwe mzimilizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">saviya yuwe mwe mazi yalozize.<verse eid="NEH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Nomsi kuwalongoza kwa ingu dikwinga nguzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:12">nechilo kuwalongoza kwa moto ukwinga nguzo kuwapulikila isila wakungwa wajinkile.”<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />“Umo awakale wetu wakatenda wekolugulu lwa Sinai waselaga kulawa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">na kulonga nawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">Kuwenka malangilizo ne izisigilizi zikungwa na zachindedi, iviya kuwenka imiko na amalagizo yedi.<verse eid="NEH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Kuwahinya watoze Idizuwa dyako dikukile dyo Kuhumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:14">niyo wawenka miko na sigilizi kujinkila mndima ywako Musa. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Umo watendaga na sala, wawenkaga nkande kulawa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">umo wakatenda na nchilu wawenkaga mazi yalaile mwe luwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">Niyo wawagamba wengile na kuiguha isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">welisaga kugamba nowenke.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />Mna, wakale wetu weduvyaga na kutenda na singo ndala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:16">awo hawatimile amalagizo yako.<verse eid="NEH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Walemela kukwiva weye, wajala yose udamanye mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">ne izimpituko udamanye mwawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Watenda na singo ndala na mo kukuhituka weye wasagulaga chilongozi vileke wauye koutumwa wawo uko Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Mna weye Chohile wimta kulekeila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">wimta ungi naho kumema wedi na mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">hukusunguza kwihiwa, kumema ungi, ivyo huwalekile.<verse eid="NEH 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Hata weze wadamanye tukulu dikwinga ndama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">niyo wakuhuluta wakagamba, ‘Yuno nuyo mnungu ywenyu awalavizeni kweisi ya Misili,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">watenda mbuli zikwihizisa.”<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />“Kwachausa cha mbazi zako zilozize huwalekile kwedijangwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">Nomsi diya idingu dikwinga nguzo hailekile kuwalongoza mweisila yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">naho moto ukwinga nguzo nechilo hailekile kuwamulikila isila waungigwe watimile.<verse eid="NEH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Kuwegaila muye wako wedi vileke uwahinye cho kudamanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">Hulekile kuwenka mkate ukwitangwa mana ukulawa kwembingu na kuwenka mazi wakatenda na nchilu.<verse eid="NEH 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Kwa mihilimo milongo mine kuwatunduliya kwedijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">hawaswesize chintu chochose, suche zawo hazisakale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">naho iviga vyawo havivimbile.”<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />“Weye kuwambiza wakale wetu wahude useuta ne si ntuhu zihakane nazo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">Waiguha isi ya Heshiboni alongoze seuta Sihoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">neisi ya Bashani alongoze seuta Ogu.<verse eid="NEH 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Kuwenka wakale wetu wana walozese saviya ntondo za koulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">weye kuwalongoza na kwingila mweisi idya uwagambile wakale wawo nowenke.<verse eid="NEH 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Welekwa wawo niyo waiguha isi na kuikala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">Kuwadahiza wawahude awekazi wa Kanani nawakekala mweisi iyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">Kuwenka udahi wantu wako wa Izulaeli wawatende seivyo wakunga wantu wa Kanani na seuta ywawo.<verse eid="NEH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Wakale wetu niyo wataha mizi yazengelwe ngome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na si ina sanga ntana, waguha nyumba zimemile vintu vyedi vyesimile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">masima yasimbigwe kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">nkonde za mizabibu na nkonde za mizaituni na miti ina ntunda zilozese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">Wadya na kwiguta wadamana vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">webwedesa mwe vintu vyedi vilozize uwenkile.”<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />“Mna hawatimile viya ulongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">sigilizi zako wazilemela na kuzileka kunyuma kwawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">Waoni wandile wakawafunda vileke wakuwiye weye wawakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">wakuhulutisa.<verse eid="NEH 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Ivyo, niyo wawaleka wahudwe ni wankondo wawo wawasulumize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">Mna umo weze wasulumizwe niyo wakwilila weye uwambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">kulawa kwembingu kuweva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">kwa mbazi zako zilozize niyo wawenka vilongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">wawambule kulawa mwe imikono ya awankondo wawo.”<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />“Mna umo utondowazi ukawawiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">niyo wakola masa vituhu kulongozi kwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Ivyo, weye niyo wawaleka walongozwe ni wankondo wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Weze wakwilile vituhu niyo waweva kulawa kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">kwa mbazi zako niyo wawakombola chila nkanana.”<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />“Kuwafunda vileke watimile imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">mna weduvya hawatimile amalagizo yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">Wakola masa hawatimile izisigilizi zako yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">hata hegu kwa kutimila izisigilizi izo kwamtenda mtu ekale vyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">Mna niyo watenda wankani walemela kutimila viya ulongile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">Watenda na singo ndala walemela kukwetegeleza.<verse eid="NEH 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Kwa mihilimo ilozize kuwajijimiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">Kwa sila ya Muye wako kuwafunda kujinkila waoni wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">Mna hawajeile mwemitwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">niyo wawaleka wahudye ni wantu we izisi ntuhu.<verse eid="NEH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Mna kwaviya weye kumema mbazi huwalekile wakomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:31">kwaviya weye Chohile kumema mbazi na wedi mta kulekeila.”<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />“Mna kaula, dyelo suwe chi watumwa mwe isi uwenkile wakale wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">weye mkulu mta nguvu! Mta kogofya, mta kutoza lagano dyako dya ungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">kumbuka izinkunto zino chinanazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">mwa amaseuta wetu ne vilongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">mwa walavyantambiko wetu na waoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">wakale wetu na awantu wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">kukongela mazuwa ya maseuta wa Ashulu kubula dyelo.<verse eid="NEH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Kudamanya vikuwagila kuchikantila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">kutenda mkanuni, hata hegu suwe chidamanya wihi.<verse eid="NEH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Maseuta wetu na vilongozi wetu na walavyantambiko wetu na wakale wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">hawatimile izisigilizi zako hawatozize imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">hegu mafundo uwagambile.<verse eid="NEH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Hata umo wendile mo useuta wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">wakabweda wedi wako ukulise mwesi nkulu ina sanga ntana uwenkile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">hawakusankanile hegu kuhituka kulawa mwe izisila zawo zihiye chani wakusankanila weye.”<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />“Mna haluse chiwatumwa mwe isi uchinkile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">ina sanga yedi ikuchinka nkande.”<verse eid="NEH 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />“Kwachausa cha amasa yetu, ugoli we isi ino wegalwa kwa amaseuta wikiye wachilongoze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">Wachilongoza suwe no uludimo lwetu saviya wakunga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">Suwe chimwenkuto ikulise!”<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wadamanya wivano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />“Kwachausa che izimbuli zose zilaile, suwe wantu wa Izulaeli chaika wivano kwa kuwandika kutimila viya ulongile, suwe chawandika, hamwenga ne ivilongozi wetu na Walawi wetu na walavyantambiko wetu wajela mahula yawo”.<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="s">Awo wajeile hula dya mevano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Ywa nkongo kujela hula mwa amevano endaga sekulu Nehemiya mwana ywa Hakaliya, niyo atimila Sedekiya. <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Wakutimila ni walavyantambiko wajeile hula, Selaya na Azaliya na Yelemiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />na Pashuli na Amaliya na Malikiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />na Hatushi na Shebaniya na Maluki, <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />na Halimu na Melemoti na Obadiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />na Danieli na Ginetoni na Baluki, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />na Meshulamu na Abiya na Miyamini, <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />na Maaziya na Biligai na Shemaya. <verse eid="NEH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Mazina ya Walawi wajeile hula wendaga, Yeshuwa mwana ywa Azaniya na Binui mwelekwa ywa Henadadi na Kadimeli, <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />Walawi weyawe ni Shebaniya na Hodiya Kelita na Pelaya na Hanani, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />na Mika na Lehobu na Hashibiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zakuli na Shelebiya na Shebaniya. <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodiya na Bani na Beninu. <verse eid="NEH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Vilongozi wa Waizulaeli wajeile hula wendaga ni Paloshi na Pahati Moabu na Elamu na Zatu na Bani. <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buni na Azigadi na Bebai. <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adoniya na Bigwai na Adini. <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ateli na Hezekiya na Azuli. <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodiya na Hashumu na Bezai. <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Halifu na Anatoti na Nebai. <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magipiashi na Meshulamu na Hezili. <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Meshezabeli na Sadoki na Yadua. <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Pelatiya na Hanani na Anaya. <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hoshea na Hananiya na Hashubu. <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Haloheshi na Piliha na Shobeki. <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Lehumu na Hashabuna na Maaseya. <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Ahiya na Hanani na Anani. <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluki na Halimu na Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mevano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Vikaheza, Waizulaeli wasigaile wadamanya mevano kwa kwelisa. Wadamanye ivyo ni walavyantambiko na Walawi na wamizi we Inyumba ya Zumbe na wachemi na Wanesini na awantu wose wesentile na awantu we izisi izintuhu chani watimile imiko ya Zumbe Chohile hamwenga na awavyele wawo na awana wawo na awachiche wawo wose wendile na udahi wa kumanya mbuli. <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />Walungana na walukolo wawo na wakulu wawo, mwe kwika cheliso na kugamba wanabalanga icheliso chino nawaligitwe, naho welisa kugamba nawekale kwa kutimila imiko ya Chohile amlagize mndima ywakwe Musa. Nawatimile kwa ukanuni imiko na amalagizo yose ne izisigilizi za Zumbe, Zumbe ywetu. <verse eid="NEH 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Chelisa kugamba hachiwaloze awachiche wetu kwa awantu wakuchizunguluka, hegu kuwaloza awana wetu wechilume kwa awachiche wawo.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Umo wantu weizisi ntuhu wakwikala muno mwe isi wanegala mayombe hegu uhule vileke watage zuwa dya Kuhumula hegu zuwa dyodyose tuhu dikukile hachiwaguze. Chila mhilimo wa mfungate hachilime mwe sanga naho nachilekeile amatigizo yose.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />Iviya chazumila kugamba chila mhilimo nachilavye gilamu nne ya mayuwe ya chumbu kwachausa cha kusankana mwe Inyumba ya Chohile.<verse eid="NEH 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Iviya nachilavye amayuwe ayo ye chumbu vileke yaguile vintu saviya mikate ikukile na malavyo ya mazwela na uhule na malavyo ya kutikimya kwachausa cha malavyo ya zuwa dya Kuhumula na ngasu za kutontomoka kwa mnenge na izingasu ntuhu zilagizwe, na kwachausa cha malavyo ya kukile na kwachausa cha malavyo ya kusa masa chani kudamanya wivano kwachausa cha Izulaeli na kwachausa che izindima zose za mwe Inyumba ya Chohile ywetu.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />Suwe walavyantambiko na Walawi na awantu, nachitowe tegatega chila mhilimo chani chimanye ni lukolo luhi lukungwa lwigale nkuni za kujimbila moto mwe imazabahu imwenyumba ya Zumbe Chohile ywetu saviya viwandikwe mwe Isigilizi.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Iviya chelisa kugamba chila mhilimo wantu mwe izikaya nawegale malimbulo yo ulozo wetu ne izintunda za nkongo za chila mti mwe Inyumba ya Chohile.<verse eid="NEH 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Naho, saviya viwandikwe mwe Isigilizi, nachiwalete awelekwa wetu wa nkongo we chilume kwa walavyantambiko wakusankana uko chani wawasente kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile na welekwa wa nkongo wo uludimo lwetu kugamba njeku na mabunga ya ndolome na mavulata mwe Inyumba ya Chohile ywetu, kwachausa cha walavyantambiko wakusankana uko.<verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Ukaleka ayo, nachilete unga ulawane na ulozo wetu wa nkongo mwe izinkonde zetu kwachausa cha walavyantambiko, na malavyo yetu yo uhule ne izintunda ze imiti yetu yose ne idivai yetu mpya na mavuta. Nachilete mafungu ya mlongo kwa Walawi, kwaviya Walawi nawo wakuchisanya amafungu ya mlongo mwe imizi yose nachidamanye ndima. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Mlavyantambiko mwelekwa ywa Haluni natende hamwenga na Walawi umo wakahokele amafungu ya mlongo, Walawi nawo waungwa wegale mafungu ya mlongo mwe ivyumba vyo kwikiya ivintu mwe Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Wantu wa Izulaeli hamwenga na Walawi vyaungwa wegale malavyo yawo yo uhule ne idivai impya na mavuta ye mizaituni mwe ivyumba vyo kwikiya ivintu hantu hakwikigwa ivimpandwa vya ahantu hakukile na aho wakwikala walavyantambiko wakusankana mo luzo na wamizi we Inyumba ya Chohile na awachemi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:39">Hachileke kuitunduliya Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile ywetu.<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s">Wekazi wekale komzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Elo, vilongozi wa wantu niyo wekala komzi wa Yelusalemu, wantu watuhu wose niyo watowa tegatega mntu yumwenga akulaila mwe wantu mlongo umwenga aite akekale komzi ukukile wa Yelusalemu, wadya chenda wakusigala waite wakekale kwemizi yawo wenye. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Wantu wawatogola wadya waungile wenye wakekale ko mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Hata ivyo, mwe imizi imituhu, wantu wa Izulaeli na walavyantambiko na Walawi na wandima mwe Inyumba ya Chohile na welekwa wa awandima wa Sulemani wajendeleza kwikala mwe isi ya Yuda, chila mntu hantu hakwe mwenye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:3">Luno lukutimila ni ludongo lwa vilongozi we imizi wetile kwikala komzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Kulawa mwa awelekwa we idikabila dya Yuda ne idikabila dya Benjamini wekale uko Yelusalemu ni Ataya mwana ywa Uziya mwezukulu ywa Zakaliya. Wakale wakwe watuhu ni Amaliya na Shefatiya mwana ywa Mahalaleli mwelekwa ywa Pelesi. <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Na Maseya mwana ywa Baluki mwezukulu ywa Kolihoze. Wakale wakwe watuhu ni Hazaya na Adaya na Yoyalibu mwana ywa Zekaliya mwelekwa ywa Shela.<verse eid="NEH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Welekwa wa Pelesi wekale komzi wa Yelusalemu ni magana mane milongo mtandatu na mnane, wagosi wakudaha kugomba nkondo. <verse eid="NEH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Wantu we ikaya ye idikabila dya Benjamini wasagulwe wakekale komzi wa Yelusalemu ni Salu mwana ywa Meshulamu mwana ywa Yoedi. Wakale wakwe watuhu ni Pedaya na Kolaya na Maseya na Itieli na Yeshaya, <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />na walukolo waidi wa Salu, Gabai na Salai iviya wekalaga komzi wa Yelusalemu. Wantu wose chahamwenga walaile kwe idikabila dya Benjamini wekale komzi wa Yelusalemu ni wantu magana chenda milongo midi na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Yoeli mwana ywa Zikili nuyo endaga sekulu ywawo mkulu na Yuda mwanawe dya Hasenua endaga sekulu mwambizi mo umzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Walavyantambiko wekale komzi wa Yelusalemu wendaga ni Yedaya mwana ywa Yoyalibu na Yakini. <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Selaya mwana ywa Hilikiya mwezukulu ywa Meshulamu. Wakale wakwe watuhu ni Sadoki na Melayoti na Ahitubu uyo endaga mlavyantambiko mkulu. <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />Wose chahamwenga wendaga walukolo magana mnane milongo midi na waidi wasankane mwe Inyumba ya Chohile. Mlavyantambiko mtuhu ekale komzi wa Yelusalemu endaga ni Adaya mwana ywa Yelohamu mwwana ywa Peleliya. Amzi na Zekaliya na Pashihuli na Makiya. <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />Wose chahamwenga vilongozi wa nkolo wendaga magana maidi milongo mine na waidi. Iviya kwendaga na Amashai mwana ywa Azaleli mwana ywa Ahizai. Wakale wakwe watuhu wendaga ni Meshilemoti na Imeli <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />Kwendaga na wantu gana dimwenga milongo midi na mnane mo lukolo luno wendaga wagomba nkondo wakankalu. Chilongozi ywawo endaga ni Zabudieli mwana ywa Hagedolimu. <verse eid="NEH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Welekwa wa Walawi wekale komzi wa Yelusalemu ni Shemaya mwana ywa Hashubu mwana ywa Azilikamu. Wakale wakwe watuhu ni Hashabiya na Buni. <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Walawi waidi watuhu, Shebatai na Yozabadi, awo wendaga vilongozi wachimaile ndima za kuse kwe Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Mataniya mwana ywa Mika mwana ywa Zabudi mwelekwa ywa Asafu, uyo endaga chilongozi ywa bunga dya wachemi wakulavya ntogozi na malombezo, mwambizi ywakwe endaga ni Bakubukiya. Mtuhu ni Abuda mwana ywa Shamuwa mwana ywa Galali mwelekwa ywa Yedutuni.<verse eid="NEH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Chahamwenga Walawi wekale komzi ukukile wa Yelusalemu wendaga magana maidi milongo mnane na wane. <verse eid="NEH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Wamizi we izinchili ze Inyumba ya Chohile wendaga ni Akubu na Talimoni na walukolo wawo watuhu chahamwenga wendaga wantu gana dimwenga milongo mfungate na waidi.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Waizulaeli wasigaile hamwenga na walavyantambiko na Walawi nawekala kwemizi yawo wenye uko Yuda chila mntu hantu ha tati yakwe. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Mna awandima we Inyumba ya Chohile wekalaga kwa kagulu ka Ofeli uko Yelusalemu. Ziha na Gishipa nawo wendile vilongozi wawo.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Mkulu ywa Walawi uko komzi wa Yelusalemu endaga ni Uzi mwana ywa Bani mwana ywa Hashabiya. Wakale wakwe watuhu wendaga ni Mataniya na Mika. Uzi endaga ni yumwenga mwa awelekwa wa Asafu, awo ndima yawo yendaga ni kusankana kuchema mwe Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Seuta nendile kalagiza kuwalanga izinkolo zitende na luzo lwa kulongoza kuchema chila zuwa mwe Inyumba ya Chohile ne ivintu wakungwa wadamanye.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petahiya mwana ywa Meshezabeli yumwenga ywa welekwa wa Zela we idikabila ywa Yuda, uyo endaga akachimala hantu ha seuta mwe mbuli zose za wantu wa Yuda.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu mwe imizi mituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Wantu wasiku wadya hewekale komzi wa Yelusalemu, awo wekala kwevijiji hajihi ne izinkonde zawo. Wantu walaile mwe idikabila dya Yuda wekalaga mwe vijiji vizunguluke mwe imizi ya Kiliati Aliba na Diboni na Yekabuzeli. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Wamwenga wekalaga komzi wa Yeshuwa na Molada na Beti Peleti, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />komzi wa Hazali Shuali na komzi wa Beli Sheba ne ivijiji vyakwe. <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Watuhu wekalaga kwemizi ya Zikilagi na Mekona ne ivijiji vihajihi nayo, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />na Eni Limoni na Zola na Yalimuti, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />na Zanoa na Adulamu ne ivijiji vihajihi ne imizi iyo. Iviya wekalaga Lakishi na mwezinkonde zihajihi na Azeka na ivijiji vyakwe. Ivyo nikugamba wantu wa Yuda wekalaga kukongela Beli Sheba ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi na kwedibwandasi dya Hinomu ntendele ya chenya.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Welekwa wa Benjamini wekalaga kwe imizi ya Mikimashi na Ai na mzi wa Beteli ne ivijiji vihajihi nayo. <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Iviya wekalaga kwemizi ya Anatoti na Nobu na Ananiya. <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Mwemizi ya Hazoli na Lama na Gitaimu. <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Mwemizi ya Hadidi na Zeboimu na Nebalati. <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Mwemizi ya Lodi na Ono na mwedibwandasi dya wantu Mafundi. <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Mabunga masiku ya welekwa wa Walawi nawakekala komzi wa Yuda wakahangana na wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s">Ludongo lwa Walavyantambiko na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Wano wakutimila ni walavyantambiko na welekwa wa Walawi wawiye kulawa ko usamizo hamwenga na Zelubabeli mwana ywa Sheliteli hamwenga na mlavyantambiko mkulu Yoshuwa kulawa Babeli kwiza Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:1">Awo wendaga, Selaya na Yelemiya na Ezila. <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amaliya na Maluki na Hatushi. <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Shekaniya na Lehumu na Melemoti. <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Ido na Ginetoni na Abiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyamini na Moadi na Biliga. <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shemaya na Yoyalibu na Yedaya. <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Salu na Amoki na Hilikiya na Yedaya. Wose awo wendaga vilongozi wa walayantimbiko chipindi Yeshuwa akatenda ni mlavyantambiko mkulu. <verse eid="NEH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Yano yakutimila ni mazina ya Walawi wendile vilongozi wa wachemi wa nchemo za ntogozi, Yeshuwa na Binui na Kadimieli na Shelebiya na Yuda hamwenga na Mataniya. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Bakibuya na Uni na welekwa watuhu wa Walawi nawakachimala mpezo mwawo wakaisana kuchema umo wantu wakavika.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa mlavyantambiko mkulu Yeshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yeshuwa endaga ise dya Yoiakimu, Yoiakimu endaga ise dya Eliyashibu, Eliyashibu endaga ise dya Yoyada. <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyada endaga ise dya Yonasani na Yonasani endaga ise dya Yadua.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu wa nkolo za walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Umo Yoakimi endaga Mlavyantambiko Mkulu, kwendaga na vilongozi wa nkolo za walavyantambiko. Melaya kulawa lukolo lwa Selaya na Hananiya kulawa lukolo lwa Yelemiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Meshulamu kulawa lukolo lwa Ezila, Yehohanani kulawa lukolo lwa Amaliya. <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Yonasani kulawa lukolo lwa Maluki na Yusufu kulawa lukolo lwa Shebaniya. <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Adina kulawa lukolo lwa Halimu na Helikai kulawa lukolo lwa Melayoti. <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Zekaliya kulawa lukolo lwa Ido na Meshulamu kulawa lukolo lwa Ginetoni. <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Zikili kulawa lukolo lwa Abiya, iviya kwendaga na chilongozi kulawa lukolo lwa Miyamini na lukolo lwa Maaziya na lukolo lwa Pilitai kulawa lukolo lwa Moadiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Shamuwa kulawa lukolo lwa Biligai, Yehonasani kulawa lukolo lwa Shemaya. <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Metenai kulawa lukolo lwa Yoyalibu, Uzi kulawa lukolo lwa Yedaya. <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Kalai kulawa lukolo lwa Salu, Ebeli kulawa lukolo lwa Amoki. <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Hashabiya kulawa lukolo lwa Hilikiya na Netaneli kulawa lukolo lwa Yedaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu we izikaya za walavyantambiko na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Mwe mihilimo Eliyashibu na Yoyada na Yohanani na Yaduwa wendaga Walavyantambiko Wakulu, kwawandikagwa ludongo lwa mazina ya nkolo za welekwa wa Walawi. Ludongo ulo lwadumaga kuwandikwa umo Dalio eze atende seuta ywa Uwajemi. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Wakulu wa nkolo za welekwa wa Walawi wawandikwa mwe chitabu cha lukumbusa kubula Yohanani mwezukulu ywa Eliyashibu akatenda Mlavyantambiko Mkulu.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhokelezana ndima mwe Inyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Vilongozi wa Walawi wendaga ni Hashabiya na Shelebiya na Yeshuwa na Binui na Kadimeli. Walawi awo waikwa mwe mabunga maidi, mabunga ayo nendile yakasinyana mo kuchema nchemo za ntogozi na kuhongeza saviya alagize seuta Daudi mntu ywa Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Wamizi wendile wakamila kwe izinchili ze inyumba yo kwikiya vintu wendaga ni Mataniya na Bakibukiya na Obadiya na Meshulamu na Talimoni na Akubu. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Wasankana mwe indima iyo umo Yoakimu mwana ywa Yeshuwa mwezukulu ywa Yozadaki akatenda nuyo Mlavyantambiko Mkulu na Nehemiya nuyo sekulu mwe isi, na Ezila nuyo mlavyantambiko na mta kuwandika.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemiya asenta ichiwambaza chomzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Umo ichiwambaza chomzi wa Yelusalemu chikasentwa, Walawi wezaga kulawa uko na wakekala walungana na suwe mo kudamanya ingasu kwa mbwedo wo kusentwa ichiwambaza. Chiwagamba wacheme nchemo za ntunyo na ntogozi wakajeseza magunda na visindamgunda na mazeze. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Iviya wachemi wechisanywa kulawa umo na wakekala kuzunguluka umzi wa Yelusalemu na ivijiji vyo umzi wa Netofati, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />kulawa Beti Giligali na kulawa Geba na Azimaweti. Wachemi awo wazengaga vijiji wekale kuzunguluka umzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Walavyantambiko na Walawi weze waheze kwekukukiza saviya vili amazwela yawo niyo wawakukiza wantu ne izinchili ne ichiwambaza. <verse eid="NEH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Niyo nawachisanya vilongozi wa Yuda wakwele kulanga kwechiwambaza. Niyo nalagiza mabunga maidi makulu ya wachemi wacheme nchemo za kumtogola Chohile. Bunga dimwenga dikwele mlanga mwe chiwambaza wajende ntendele ya kulume kuhinga kweinchili ya Kwedizala. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Hoshaya ne inusu ye ivilongozi wa Yuda wawatimila mnyuma awachemi. <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />Waalavyantambiko wano, Azaliya na Ezila na Meshulamu wawatimila mnyuma wakavila magunda, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Yuda na Benjamini na Shemaya na Yelemiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />Vikaheza niyo atimila Zekaliya mwana ywa Yonasani mwezukulu ywa Shemaya. Wakale wakwe watuhu ni Mataniya na Mikaya na Zakuli mwana ywa Asafu. <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />Kunyuma kwawo nendile wakatimilwa ni welekwa watuhu wo ulukolo lwa Zekaliya. Shemaya na Azaleli na Milalai na Gilalai na Maai na Nesaneli na Yuda na Hanani. Wose awo nendile wenula vimpandwa vya kuchemela, saviya ajeseze Daudi mntu nywa Chohile. Ezila mta kuwandika nuyo alongoze idibunga idyo. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Kweinchili ye Sokwe wajendeleza ulo na ulo wabula kweizintantilo kuhinga komzi wa Daudi niyo wajinka idizumba dye chiseuta dya Daudi kubula kwe Inchili ya Amazi ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="NEH 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Bunga dya kaidi dya wachemi dihinga ntendele ya kumoso. Siwatimila mnyuma chikatenda mlanga mwe ichiwambaza, hamwenga ne inusu ya awantu mnyuma mo mnala we Iditanuli kubula kwe Ichiwambaza Changalamu. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Kulawa aho chihinga kujinkila Kweinchili ya Efulaimu ne Inchili ya Yeshana ne Inchili ya Samaki na komnala wa Hananeli no mnala wa wagombankondo Gana, kubula kweinchili ye Izingoto. Weze wabule Kweinchili yo Wamizi niyo wachimala. Chibindiliza ukujenda kwetu hajihi ne Inchili ikuhinga kwe Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Mabunga yadya amaidi ya awachemi yabula kwe Inyumba ya Chohile na kujendeleza kumtogola chila dimwenga niyo dyachimala hantu hakwe, miye hamwenga ne inusu ye ivilongozi. <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />Mwedibunga dyangu walavyantambiko wendile wakatowa magunda yawo ni Eliyakimu na Maaseya na Miniamini na Mikaya na Elioenai na Zekaliya na Hananiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />Watuhu watimile ni Maaseya na Shemaya na Eliazali na Uzi na Yehohanani na Malikiya na Elamu na Ezeli. Mabunga ayo yachema kwa izwi kulu wakalongozwa ni Yezilahiya.<verse eid="NEH 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Zuwa idyo wantu walavya ntambiko zilozize wakatenda wamema mbwedo kwaviya Chohile kawenka mbwedo ukulise. Iviya wavyele na wana welunga hamwenga nawo mo mbwedo uwo. Chizumo cho mbwedo we ngasu chivika hale vitendese.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwemalanya kwachausa cha mviko mwe Inyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Chipindi icho wantu wasagulwa chani wachimaile ivyumba vyo kwikiya nchango nazilavigwe mwe Inyumba Ya Chohile na malimbulo na mafungu ya mlongo. Kulawa kweizinkonde zizunguluke umzi nawakaungwa wegale malavyo mwe ihazina saviya vilagizwe mwe isigilizi kwachausa cha walavyantambiko na Walawi. Wantu wose wa Yuda nendile welelwa ni indima naikadamanywa ni walavyantambiko na Walawi, <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />kwaviya wadamanya mviko wa kwetenda wazumilike kumvikila Chohile, wachemi na wamizi we inchili nawo wadamanya seivyo kuligana ne idilagizo dya Daudi na mwanawe Sulemani. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Kukongela chipindi Daudi akatenda seuta na Asafu akatenda chilongozi ywa wachemi, wachemi nendile wakawalongoza wantu kuchema nchemo za kumtunya na kumtogola Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Ivyo, mwamazuwa ayo Zelubabeli na Nehemiya wakatenda vilongozi, wantu wose wa Izulaeli chila zuwa walavya malavyo kwachausa cha wachemi na wamizi we izinchili. Iviya wasenta fungu tuhu kwachausa cha Walawi, Walawi nawo niyo wasenta fungu kwachausa cha welekwa wa mlavyantambiko Haluni.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wawapagula Wajeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Umo ichitabu che Isigilizi ya Musa chize chisomwe kwa izwi kulu mwa wantu wose, niyo wabwila hantu hawandikwe kugamba havikungwa Waamoli hegu Mmoabu watendeke mo mdugano wa awantu wa Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Kwaviya wantu wa Amoni na Wamoabu hawawenkile nkande na mazi Waizulaeli umo wakatenda mweisila wakalawa kweisi ya Misili, hantu hakwe wamfumbasa hela Balamu vileke awaligite wantu wa Izulaeli. Mna Chohile ywetu kahituila ligito ditenda ujimbiko. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Ivyo wantu wa Izulaeli weze weve ulosi uwo we Isigilizi niyo wawapagfula wantu wose sawo Waizulaeli wamlawe mwawo.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemiya achulusa mbuli uhya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Zuwa idyo dye ingasu hedinati, mlavyantambiko Eliyashibu mta kuchimaila vyumba vyo kwikiya vintu mwe Inyumba ya Chohile ywetu, uyo nendile ni mbuya vitendese na Tobiya mnkondo ywetu. <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />Eliyashibu amlekeilaga Tobiya kujeseza chumba chikulu, chumba icho mwe nkongo nendile kikajesezwa kwikiwa malavyo ya uhule na ufumba na viya vye Inyumba ya Chohile, hamwenga na fungu dya mlongo dya uhule na divai mpya na mavuta walagizwe Waizulaeli wawenke Walawi na wachemi na wadimi we Inyumba ya Chohile hamwenga na malavyo ya walavyantambiko. <verse eid="NEH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Mna umo Tobiya akajeseza ichumba icho miye nendile sikuli komzi wa Yelusalemu, kwaviya mo mhilimo wa milongo mitatu na midi yo ulongozi wa Atashasita seuta ywa Babeli nendile suya kwa seuta kulawa Yelusalemu, mazuwa majeche yeze yomboke niyo namweila seuta anileke nuye vituhu Yelusalemu, vyaleka anilekeila nite. <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Nize niye Yelusalemu naho nibunkule imbuli iyo yo wihi Eliyashibu adamanye ya kumwinka Tobiya chumba mwe izinyuwa ze Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Niyo nehiwa vitendese, navidula kuse iviya vyose vya Tobiya. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Silagiza ivyumba vikukizwe ne ivimpandwa vye Inyumba ya Chohile, hamwenga na amalavyo yo uhule na ubani, vize viheze niyo navivuza mndani. <verse eid="NEH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Iviya niyo nabunkula kugamba mafungu yaungigwe wenkigwe Walawi nendile hawakwinkwa, iviya Walawi wose na wacheni wendile wakaungwa wasankane mwenyumba ya Chohile wauya Yelusalemu na kwita kwezinkonde zawo, kwaviya wantu wa Izulaeli nendile hawakuwenka vintu nawakaungwa wawenke. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Niyo nawakwamila masekulu na kuwauza, “Nimbwani Inyumba ya Chohile ihufywa?” Niyo nawetanga Walawi na wachemi nawavuza vituhu mwe indima yawo yo kusankana mwe Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Vikaheza wantu wose wa Yuda niyo wakonga vituhu kuleta mafungu yawo ya mlongo yo mpuluzi na divai mpya na mavuta ya mazaituni mwe ihazina ye Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Niyo nawasagula mlavyantambiko Shelemiya na Sadoki mta kuwandika na Mlawi akwitangwa Pedaya watende wachimaila we impamba naho simsagula Hanani mwana ywa Zakuli mwezukulu ywa Mataniya atende mwambizi ywawo, kwaviya wantu wano wawoneka kutenda wakanuni, wenkigwa ndima ya kuwapangila vintu wandima weyawe. <verse eid="NEH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Weye Chohile ywangu nikumbuka kwa dino nidamanye, usekujala chiya nidamanye kwa ukanuni kwachausa che Inyumba yako na kuvuza uhya izimbuli viya zikungwa zitende. <verse eid="NEH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Mwa amazuwa ayo siwona wantu wasiku mweisi ya Yuda wadamanya ndima ya kufumbula zabibu mwe idizuwa dyo Kuhumula, wegala mpuluzi wakwezize mwe mpunda hamwenga na divai na zabibu na ntunda zikwitwangwa tini na mavunje matuhu yesimile. Awo nawakegala ivyo vyose komzi wa Yelusalemu mwedizuwa dyo Kuhumula. Elo, niyo nawafunda wasekutaga chintu chochose mwe idizuwa idyo dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Iviyo siwona wantu wasiku kulawa komzi wa Tilo wendile wakekala Yelusalemu wegale samaki zilozize na vintu vyesimile na kuwatagila wantu wa Yuda na Yelusalemu mwe idizuwa dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Ivyo, niyo nawakwamila masekulu wa Yuda nawagamba, “Ni wihi wani uno mkudamanya wa kuhuluta zuwa dyo Kuhumula? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Togolani wakale wenyu hawadamanye mbuli seizo na kuhosa Chohile ywetu egale file mwetu na mo mzi uno? Haluse mchei mwamsonga maya mwa Waizulaeli kwa kuhuluta zuwa dyo Kuhumula.” <verse eid="NEH 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Ivyo niyo nalagiza kugamba izinchili zo umzi wa Yelusalemu zivugalwe chila chikabula chisingi cha zuwa dyo Kuhumula chiza chikakonga, naho zisekuvugulwa kubula zuwa dyo Kuhumula diheza. Niyo naika wantu wangu wasiku mwe izinchili nawamanye kugamba hahana mafulutundu yoyose nayengizwe mndani mo mzi mwe idizuwa dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Nkanana imwenga hegu mbili wachuluzi na wata kutaga mayombe wagona kuse komzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Mna niyo nawafunda nawagamba, “Nimbwani mkugona hajihi ne ichiwambaza? Hegu mnadamanya seivyo vituhu nawakantilani.” Kukongela aho hawezile vituhu zuwa dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Haheza niyo nawalagiza Walawi wetende wazumilike kwa Chohile chani waite wakamile izinchili watunduliye idizuwa dyo Kuhumula ditende dikuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Weye Chohile ywangu nikumbuka naho kwachausa ya chino nidamanye, unilagise wedi wako kuligana na ungi wako mkulu. <verse eid="NEH 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Ukale ayo, iviya siwona wantu wa Yuda wendile wasola wavyele kulawa Ashidodi na Amoni na Moabu. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Inusu ya awana wawo nendile wakalonga Chiashidodi hegu longa dya wantu watuhu, wadunduga kulonga idilonga dyetu dye Ichiyahudi. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Siwakwamila na kuwaligita. Wantu wasiku siwatowa na kuwang'ola izifili zawo. Niyo nawawapiza kwa zina dya Chohile kugamba, Msekuwaloza wachiche wenyu kwa wabwanga wawo hegu wachiche wawo wasekusolwa ni wabwanga wenyu hegu nyuwe wenye msekusola kwawo. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Siwagamba, “Togolani seuta Sulemani hakoile masa kwachausa cha wavyele saviya awo. Mgati izisi zilozize hakwendaga na seuta akwinga uyo. Nakaungiswa ni Chohile ywakwe. Chohile naye kamtenda seuta mweisi yose ya Izulaeli, mna wavyele we izisi ntuhu wamtenda uyo naye akole masa. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Togolani, mwafanyanya kugamba suwe chitimile ivyo mdamanye nyuwe, chisekumwiva Chohile ywetu kwa kusola wavyele wajeni wakuvikila matukulu?”<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Mwana yumwenga ywa Yoyada mwana ywa Eliyashibu mlavyantambiko mkulu nedile kasola mchiche ywa mnkondo ywetu Sanibalati kulawa komzi wa Beti Holoni. Miye niyo nambalaza amlawe mo mzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Weye Chohile ywangu, usekuwajala kwaviya wajela uzavu ulavyantambiko ne idilagano dyo ulavyantambiko na dya Walawi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Ivyo niyo nawatenda wantu wazumilike kwa Chohile kulawana na chintu chochose cha chijeni na kuwenka walavyantambiko na Walawi chila yumwenga mwe ndima yakwe. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Iviya sikombaganya kugamba wantu wegala nkuni mwe chipindi chikungwa na malimbulo mwe chipindi chakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Weye Chohile ywangu usekujala yano nidamanye, nijimbika kwa yano nidamanye.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>